# Session initialization

1. Read `AGENTS.md` first. It is the single source of engineering
   invariants.
2. Read `plan/STATUS.md` if it exists (current phase, next task,
   blocked items). `plan/` is gitignored and local-only.
3. Read `docs/roadmap.md` for phase, status, and the revision-history
   header before picking work.
4. Before changing a public contract (event, metric, clock, state,
   export), read the relevant spec in `docs/specs/` and decision in
   `docs/decisions/`, and follow the `architecture-design` skill.
5. Do not write production code before P0 is `Accepted`. Crate
   skeletons that compile but contain no production logic are allowed
   as harness.
6. A task is done only when `just ci` is green and evidence is attached
   (AGENTS.md: evidence-based completion). Never invent measurements.
